WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.434
-Welcome, everybody.
Welcome, welcome, welcome to

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:04.000
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.767
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]
This is it.

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:09.300
You guys, everyone is excited.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.634
This Sunday is Super Bowl LVII,

00:00:11.634 --> 00:00:14.934
between the Kansas City Chiefs
and the Philadelphia Eagles.

00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:17.868
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]
[Indistinct]

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:22.367
Yep, the players have dreamed
of this their whole lives

00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:24.400
and, this weekend,
they finally get to see Rihanna.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.734
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:00:26.734 --> 00:00:28.734
That's right.
Rihanna said that she's been

00:00:28.734 --> 00:00:31.434
so focused on the show, that she
forgot about Valentine's Day.

00:00:31.434 --> 00:00:32.801
[ Awws and laughter ]

00:00:32.801 --> 00:00:33.934
Yeah, and you know a bunch
of guys

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:35.267
are going to now use
that excuse.

00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:37.133
[ Laughter ]
Like, "Oh, I forgot about it

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:39.801
because I was so focused
on Rihanna's halftime show."

00:00:39.801 --> 00:00:41.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.467
This year's Super Bowl will be
watched in 180 countries.

00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:46.367
-Wow!
-Well, 179,

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:48.200
now that we took out
the Chinese spy balloon.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.167
[ Laughter and applause ]
They will not be wa--

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:50.567
They won't be watching.

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:53.133
I love everything about the
Super Bowl, especially the food.

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:55.934
You know you ate too much when
you arrive in an Eagles jersey

00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:57.367
and leave in an Eagles crop top.

00:00:57.367 --> 00:00:58.501
[ Laughter ]
You know what I'm saying?

00:00:58.501 --> 00:01:02.234
[ Applause ]

00:01:02.234 --> 00:01:04.133
We all overdo it
at Super Bowl parties,

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:05.767
but the best way
to curb your appetite?

00:01:05.767 --> 00:01:08.467
Just watch your uncle sucking
a wing bone for the first half.

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:11.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:12.367
"Alright, hey, good, alright.

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:14.200
Come on, you did enough there,
alright? Yeah.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.601
-Ooh.
-Yeah, alright. Yep, yep, yep.

00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:16.734
There's nothing left --
-[ Smacking lips ]

00:01:16.734 --> 00:01:18.033
-There's nothing left on that.

00:01:18.033 --> 00:01:18.801
Hey, come on!"

00:01:18.801 --> 00:01:19.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:20.334
-[ Pop ]

00:01:20.334 --> 00:01:22.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:24.734
-Unfortunately,
due to inflation, everybody --

00:01:24.734 --> 00:01:25.634
I forgot to tell
everyone this --

00:01:25.634 --> 00:01:26.767
seven-layer dip's now been

00:01:26.767 --> 00:01:27.934
cut back to three layers.

00:01:27.934 --> 00:01:29.434
[ Laughter ]
-Oh.
-I'm sorry.

00:01:29.434 --> 00:01:30.934
Yeah, the Super Bowl
can be hard.

00:01:30.934 --> 00:01:32.934
We drink all day,
but can't go to the bathroom

00:01:32.934 --> 00:01:34.834
during the game, halftime,
or commercials.

00:01:34.834 --> 00:01:38.200
[ Laughter ]
Of course, fans of both teams
will be tailgating.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.467
It's the one time you see
a bunch of people outside a van

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:42.033
and think,
"Yeah, I should go over there.

00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:44.667
[ Laughter ]
Hey, what's up, guys?"

00:01:44.667 --> 00:01:45.767
And get this -- First Lady

00:01:45.767 --> 00:01:48.167
and Philadelphia Eagles fan
Jill Biden

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:49.634
is attending the Super Bowl.

00:01:49.634 --> 00:01:52.267
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]
Yeah.

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.300
First, the Grammys;
now, the Super Bowl.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.534
Who knew Jill would be living
the same life as Rihanna?

00:01:58.534 --> 00:02:00.801
[ Laughter and applause ]
It's amazing.

00:02:00.801 --> 00:02:03.400
Yep, Jill gets to see Rihanna
perform at halftime.

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.868
Meanwhile, Joe's first halftime
show was Beethoven.

00:02:05.868 --> 00:02:09.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:09.968 --> 00:02:11.634
-Di di di da.

00:02:13.767 --> 00:02:15.467
-Mozart.
-Mozart.

00:02:15.467 --> 00:02:17.667
-Mozart was better.
Mozart was better.

00:02:17.667 --> 00:02:19.701
Switching gears --
I read that Mike Pence

00:02:19.701 --> 00:02:22.033
was just subpoenaed
by the special counsel

00:02:22.033 --> 00:02:25.334
investigating Trump's role
in the January 6th attack.

00:02:25.334 --> 00:02:26.934
-Ooh.
-Yeah, if that wasn't
bad enough,

00:02:26.934 --> 00:02:29.000
Pence fainted when he heard
the word subpoena.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.567 --> 00:02:33.968
[ Sting plays ]

00:02:33.968 --> 00:02:35.033
And finally, today,

00:02:35.033 --> 00:02:37.501
"Magic Mike's Last Dance"
hit theaters.

00:02:37.501 --> 00:02:38.234
-Whoa.

00:02:38.234 --> 00:02:41.033
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:41.033 --> 00:02:43.968
-Jill Biden was like,
"I will also be attending that."

